sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Checkout worker
    participant S as Shop DB
    participant R as Sweeper
    participant P as Payment provider
    W->>S: COMMIT co_7f3a pending,<br/>stock reserved
    W-)P: POST /charges<br/>key=co_7f3a
    Note over W,P: request held in flight
    Note over R: t = 2 s,<br/>co_7f3a is stale
    R->>P: POST /charges<br/>key=co_7f3a<br/>— the same charge
    P->>P: INSERT charge co_7f3a
    P-->>R: 200 succeeded,<br/>charge 9041
    R->>S: state = completed,<br/>INSERT order
    Note over P: t = 4 s, the first<br/>request arrives
    P->>P: ON CONFLICT (key)<br/>— charge 9041 exists
    P-->>W: 200 succeeded,<br/>charge 9041
    W->>S: UPDATE ... WHERE<br/>state = 'pending'<br/>— 0 rows
    Note over S,P: one charge, one order
